  "body": "\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nRefused to frame 'https://matrix.instance.com/' because an ancestor violates the following Content Security Policy directive: \"frame-ancestors 'none'\". Meanwhile i have put frame ancestors both for riot instance and the website with the iframe in place.\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n\r\n###  Nginx configuration\r\n\r\nadd_header Content-Security-Policy \"frame-ancestors 'self' https://site1.com https://site2.com;\";\r\n\r\n\r\n### Version information\r\n{\"server_version\":\"1.48.0\",\"python_version\":\"3.8.10\"}\r\nNginx/1.18.0(ubuntu)\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Platform**:\r\nUbuntu 18\r\n",
